          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Ancient Egypt was amazing."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "It began in 3100 BCE around the Nile River."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "From the river, Egyptians got water for farming."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "Ancient Egyptian culture was advanced."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "They were good at science and math."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "They had a written language."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "They also had their own calendar."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "The ancient Egyptians were also good at building."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "They used basic tools."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "But they cut and moved huge stones."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "With them, they made large buildings and tall monuments."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "These were very well made."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "Some are still standing thousands of years later."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
